VUE_APP_API_BASE_URL=/xiaozhi
#1. To make the web console adapt to mobile browsers, first start manager-api and get the server address (http://LAN-ip:8002/xiaozhi)
#2. In the .env of manager-mobile, change VITE_SERVER_BASEURL to your own server address, then run pnpm dev:h5 to get the h5 page address, and fill it into VUE_APP_H5_URL below
#3. Now visiting the web page from a mobile browser redirects to the h5 page adapted to mobile browsers
VUE_APP_H5_URL=